_3D.InternalClassType [SimTalk]
Returns the built-in English name of the length-oriented object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The internal class name is not the localized object name that some of the localized versions of Plant
Simulation show, but the English object name that the Class Library shows.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.InternalClassType -> string
Return Value
The return value has the data type string.
• The return values AnimatableExtrusionObject and SimulationExtrusionObject designate a length-
oriented object in 3D.
• The return values AnimatableObject and SimulationObject designate a point-oriented object in 3D.
Exceptions are the following objects with the internal class types Button, Chart, Checkbox, Comment,
Connector, Container, Display, DropDownList, Folder, Frame, Interface, Mixer, Part, PickAndPlace, Store,
Tank, Toolbar, Transporter, Variable, and Worker.
Example
var animObject : any := obj._3D.getObject(1)
if animObject.InternalClassType = "AnimatableExtrusionObject" then
   animObject.BaseHeight := 2
end
See also
InternalClassType [SimTalk]
