delete [SimTalk] - animatable object
Deletes the animatable object designated by <PathToObjectToBeDeleted>.
Remarks
Deleting an animatable object can make variables invalid which reference neighboring animatable objects!
It always makes those variables invalid which reference objects which are located within the deleted
object.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>ToObjectToBeDeleted>.delete
Example
// adds an animatable object to the Station
var MyAnimatableObject := Station._3D.addObject("MyAnimatableObject")
// deletes the animatable object from the Station
MyAnimatableObject.delete
Station._3D.getObject("MyAnimatableObject").delete
See also
_3D.addObject [SimTalk]
