_3D.getWorldCoordinate [SimTalk]
Returns the position of the object designated by <Path> in the topmost Frame.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>._3D.getWorldCoordinate([Offset:length[3]]) → length[3]
Parameter
The optional parameter Offset is an array of data type length with three values. You can use it to query the
world coordinate of the designated coordinate within the object coordinate system.
Return Value
The return value is an array of data type length with three values.
Example
print Store._3D.getWorldCoordinate(Store.getAnimationPoint(1, 1))
