_3D.TransformationMatrix [SimTalk]
Sets the entire transformation of the object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
_3D.TransformationMaxtrix can either designate a one-dimensional array of data type real with 16 values
or a two-dimensional array of data type real with four times four values.
_3D.TransformationMaxtrix is available for all fully transformable objects (stations, Frames, length-
oriented objects, Interfaces, and for the classes of the Connector, the MUs, and the Worker).
Note
Assigning the attribute deactivates graphic inheritance.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.TransformationMatrix → array
Return Value
The return value is always an array with four times four values.
