The bounding box excludes all invisible graphics.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.BoundingBoxCenter → length[3]
Return Value
The return value is an array of data type length with three values.
The values designate the X-Position, the Y-Position, and the Z-Position of the center point of the
bounding box.
Example
